Z||000006||theogre||10-03-2001||07:47 PM||||that ECM is used in other GM cars...  Grand Am and Cutlass Calais for two... You can find them in any salvage yard. all you need to do is put the Fiero prom in it. (If you fried the PROM you'll need another one. New/rebuilt ECM's don't come with them.)<P>In Grand Am and Cutlass it's under the trim pannel under the right side of the dash. Any of those cars with the 2.5l DIS motor should have one. Look for the number 1227748 on the ECM's label just to be sure.<P>edit... I missed where he's from... Those cars or some equivalent may be available down there. It wouldn't hurt to look around.<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/fullstaff.gif">   <FONT COLOR="blue"><I><B>11-Sept-01, The day the world as we knew it ended.</B></I></FONT><p>[This message has been edited by theogre (edited 10-03-2001).]||||reg||1
